  bookbeam [command]

Available Commands:
  auth        Manage authentication and tokens
  billing     Check team account billing and subscription entitlement
  completion  Generate shell completion script for your terminal
  downloaders View reader downloaders and export subscriber lists
  files       Manage book files (EPUB, MOBI, PDF) attached to projects
  help        Help about any command
  links       Manage reader signup links and landing pages
  logs        View chronological telemetry activity logs
